    "features": [
      "【COMPATIBLE WIRE GAUGE】The package contains 40 pieces of waterproof wire nuts of small-size (0.47\" outer diameter, 0.31\" inner diameter), compatible with 14AWG, 16AWG, 18AWG, 20AWG, 22AWG, meet your various needs for building or daily installations.",
      "【PREMIUM MATERIAL】The waterproof wire nuts for outdoor lights are made of high-quality PVC material, ensures durability and flexibility. Withstanding temperatures from -40℉ to 400℉ ensures they can endure extreme weather conditions, while the capability to handle up to 600V reduces the fire risk. It's essential to have such durable and high-quality connectors to safeguard your wiring systems effectively.",
      "【IP65 WATERPROOF CAP DESIGN & SILICONE SEALANT 】The waterproof end caps for outdoor wire nuts adopts IP65 waterproof design, the caps with screws and the waterproof wire connectors are pre-filled with the right amount of silicone sealant, which will overflow to seal connection, weatherproof, moisture-proof and anti-corrosion, can be exposed to condensation, water, steam or dust. Perfect fit for the wet places using.",
      "【Easy to Install】No pre-twisting required, just inserting the wire ends into the waterproof wire nut caps and twisting them together ensures a secure connection. The silicone sealant will overflow to seal the wire connection, prevent the wire ends from leaking when it encounters water and being oxidized.",
      "【WIDE APPLICATION】Their waterproof design makes these wire nuts waterproof ideal for a wide range of outdoor and electrical wire splicing tasks. From outdoor landscape lighting to building and construction projects, automotive applications, irrigation systems, and any other external wiring needs, they offer reliable performance and protection. Their ability to withstand various environmental conditions makes them a practical choice for many different applications.",
      "【LIFETIME WARRANTY】360 days return and exchange freely, If for any reasons you are not satisfied with our 40pcs waterproof wire connectors, please contact us firstly, we would like to support you friendly customer service. (Package Includes: 40* waterproof wire connectors in small size)."
    ],
